{"id": "63389", "title": "ABO之强制受孕", "author": "叫我小肉肉", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 7, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/63/63389.htm", "intro": "属性分类：古代／都市生活／强攻强受／正剧\r\n关键字：主角 配角 其他 \r\n\r\n身为一个A却被迫改造身体，强制受孕。\r\n陆锐明对肖盾恨得牙痒痒，\r\n每晚却有不得不渴求他缓解自己的发情之苦。尊严荡然无存。\r\n被不要脸又强大的星盗头子缠上，可怜的少将，自求多福吧！", "base": "files/article/html/63/63389", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "9370889.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-12", "file": "9370890.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14-22", "file": "9370892.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23-29", "file": "9370895.html", "available": false}, {"title": "30-35", "file": "9370897.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-41", "file": "9370900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "42-44完结", "file": "9370901.html", "available": false}]}